328 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 198 0 R
/T (In the modern industrial environment, machines and equipment play an important role in manufacturing, production, transportation, energy generation, and several other industrial operations. The proper functioning of these machines is essential for maintaining productivity, product quality, operational efficiency, and workplace safety. However, industrial machines may develop faults or abnormal operating conditions due to continuous usage, mechanical wear, excessive temperature, vibration, pressure variations, or component failures.)
/E (In the modern industrial environment, machines and equipment play an important role in manufacturing, production, transportation, energy generation, and several other industrial operations. The proper functioning of these machines is essential for maintaining productivity, product quality, operational efficiency, and workplace safety. However, industrial machines may develop faults or abnormal operating conditions due to continuous usage, mechanical wear, excessive temperature, vibration, pressure variations, or component failures.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 198 0 R
/E (Traditionally, industries have relied on periodic maintenance and manual inspection to identify machine faults. Although these methods are useful, they may not always detect problems at an early stage. Sometimes, a machine continues operating with unusual sensor readings until the condition becomes serious and results in unexpected failure. Such failures can cause production delays, financial losses, equipment damage, and safety risks.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
