342 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 201 0 R
/T ("To develop a deep learning-based anomaly detection system using an Autoencoder that can learn normal patterns from machine sensor readings and identify potentially abnormal conditions by analysing reconstruction errors.")
/E ("To develop a deep learning-based anomaly detection system using an Autoencoder that can learn normal patterns from machine sensor readings and identify potentially abnormal conditions by analysing reconstruction errors.")
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 201 0 R
/T (The proposed system uses an Autoencoder neural network trained on normal sensor data. The model reconstructs the input readings, and the reconstruction error is calculated by comparing the original data with the reconstructed output. If the reconstruction error exceeds a predefined threshold, the corresponding sensor reading or sequence is classified as an anomaly.)
/E (The proposed system uses an Autoencoder neural network trained on normal sensor data. The model reconstructs the input readings, and the reconstruction error is calculated by comparing the original data with the reconstructed output. If the reconstruction error exceeds a predefined threshold, the corresponding sensor reading or sequence is classified as an anomaly.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
