/E (Another important objective of this project is to understand and implement the working principle of Autoencoder neural networks for anomaly detection. An Autoencoder is designed to learn a compressed representation of input data and reconstruct the original input through its encoder and decoder components.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
