348 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 1026 0 R
/T ( The objective is to train the model using normal machine sensor readings so that it learns the characteristics of normal operating conditions. Once trained, the model can analyse new sensor readings and identify data that differs significantly from the patterns learned during training. This approach is particularly useful when labelled examples of different machine faults are limited or unavailable.)
/E ( The objective is to train the model using normal machine sensor readings so that it learns the characteristics of normal operating conditions. Once trained, the model can analyse new sensor readings and identify data that differs significantly from the patterns learned during training. This approach is particularly useful when labelled examples of different machine faults are limited or unavailable.)
/Pg 21 0 R
