/E (In this project, an Autoencoder-based architecture is used to learn the normal operating patterns of machine sensor readings. The model consists of an encoder and a decoder. The encoder compresses the input sensor data into a lower-dimensional representation, while the decoder reconstructs the original input from this representation. The difference between the original input and reconstructed output is measured using Mean Squared Error \(MSE\). )
/Pg 52 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
