/Title (The current project uses an Autoencoder architecture for anomaly detection. In future versions, advanced deep learning models such as LSTM Autoencoders, Variational Autoencoders \(VAE\), CNN-based models, and Transformer-based models can be implemented. These models may help in detecting more complex temporal and nonlinear patterns in sensor data.)
